{"_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "Peter Visits Vanessa at Work", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "The Graveyard Shift ", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 6, "type": "position"}, {"content": "stub", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 7, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "B1.2", "type": "level"}], "type": "metadata"}, {"contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}], "type": "achievment_test"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Exchange advice and suggestions in communicative situations.", "type": "primary"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. ", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. ", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. ", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. ", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. ", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. ", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. ", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. ", "type": "secondary_8"}], "type": "objectives"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Phrasal Verbs", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "A phrasal verb is a phrase formed with a verb + preposition. <br/><br/>The combination of the verb and preposition changes the meaning of the verb.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "Here are some phrasal verbs related to work:", "type": "text"}, {"content": "to follow up -- to return to a subject already discussed<br/>to run into -- to encounter, to experience<br/>to set up -- to establish, to plan<br/>to turn out -- to end by being a certain way<br/>to fill (you) in -- to inform, to tell (you)", "type": "text"}, {"content": "You conjugate phrasal verbs in the same way you conjugate other verbs.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":5,\"columns\":3,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Affirmative Form</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Question Form</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Tense</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"I go out on Saturdays.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Do you go out on Saturdays?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Present tense\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"I am going out this evening.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Are you going out this evening?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Present Continuous tense\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"I went out last Saturday.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Did you go out last Saturday?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Simple Past tense\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"I have gone out every Saturday this month.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Have you gone out every Saturday this month?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Present Perfect tense\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "I want to follow up on our meeting last week. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Sometimes we run into problems when we are short-staffed.", "type": "example"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Discussing How to Deal with Problems ", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "One way to discuss how to deal with problems is to say what you would do if you were in someone else's situation. This is a polite way of communicating if you use the modals <span class=\"italic\">would</span> or <span class=\"italic\">could</span>.<br/><br/><span class=\"italic\">I would ... <br/>I wouldn't ... <br/>You Could ... </span>", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "These are examples of Vanessa and Bruce suggesting how to deal with the problems in the restaurant. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">Bruce</span>:  Sometimes we run into problems when we are short-staffed.<br/><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>:  I wouldn't worry about it. We planned the work schedule already.  ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: We have three servers, two bus people, a kitchen manager, a soup and sauce cook and a ma\u00eetre d'. Isn't that enough?<br/><span class=\"strong\">Bruce</span>: You could add an extra sous chef and maybe a bartender. ", "type": "example"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to make sure", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to verify", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I want to make sure we have enough staff. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le07ob06aud01", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "These are words you use to talk about working in a restaurant.", "type": "text"}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to fill in", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to inform", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I'll fill you in tomorrow about my decision.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le07ob06aud02", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "graveyard shift", "type": "name"}, {"content": "work hours during the late evening or night", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: The graveyard shift is  from 10:00 p.m. to 4:00 a.m. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le07ob06aud03", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "server", "type": "name"}, {"content": "waiter or waitress; a person who waits on tables in a restaurant", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: We have three servers working tonight.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le07ob06aud04", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "bus person", "type": "name"}, {"content": "person who prepares and cleans up tables in a restaurant", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Two bus people are also on staff this evening. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le07ob06aud05", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "ma\u00eetre d'", "type": "name"}, {"content": "the host or hostess; the person who escorts customers to their place in a restaurant", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: To become a ma\u00eetre d', you should start as a server.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le07ob06aud06", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"content": "engenn7le07ob06re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"contents": [{"content": "With a partner, choose a type of restaurant. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Your friend doesn't know what to order.  Think of different items that would be on the menu.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Start your dialogue talking about the menu choices.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Explain the options.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Talk about what is advisable. Use <span class=\"italic\">\u201cought to\u201d</span> at least one time.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Conclude your dialogue with a decision for each person.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Write a total of 10 lines.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_extension"}, {"contents": [{"content": "I talk about food items on a menu.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I talk about different options.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I say what is advisable.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_assessment"}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"template_override": 1, "contents": [{}], "_data": [], "id": 0, "type": "welcome"}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "title": "", "type": "audio", "contents": [{"value": {"images": [{"image": "engenn7le07ob06re2img05.jpg", "time": "0", "id": 0, "text": ""}, {"image": "engenn7le07ob06re2img05.jpg", "time": "100", "id": 1, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Bruce</span>:  Hi Vanessa, can I have a word with you? <br/><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>:  Hi Bruce! Sure, Bruce. This is my friend Peter. <br/><span class=\"strong\">Bruce</span>:  Hello. <br/><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>:  Hi. Are you the head chef? <br/><span class=\"strong\">Bruce</span>:  Yes I am. <br/><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>:  I had the chicken drumsticks. I loved them! <br/><span class=\"strong\">Bruce</span>:  Thanks. You ought to try the roast beef next time. <br/><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>:  How can I help you, Bruce?"}, {"image": "engenn7le07ob06re2img01.jpg", "time": "21500", "id": 2, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Bruce</span>: The night shift is from 10:00 p.m. to 2:00 a.m. <br/><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>:  Oh yes, that's the graveyard shift. <br/><span class=\"strong\">Bruce</span>: I want to follow up on our meeting last week.  I recommended staying open until 4:00 a.m., but it can get very busy around midnight. I want to make sure we don't have staffing problems. Sometimes we run into problems when we are short-staffed."}, {"image": "engenn7le07ob06re2img02.jpg", "time": "45000", "id": 3, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>:  I wouldn't worry about it. We set up the work schedule already.  We have three servers, two bus people, a kitchen manager, a soup and sauce cook and a ma\u00eetre d'. Isn't that enough?<br/><span class=\"strong\">Bruce</span>: I would hire more staff. That would be very helpful.  You could always add a sous chef and maybe a bartender. <br/><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: It might turn out to be a good idea. I'll fill you in tomorrow about my decision. <br/><span class=\"strong\">Bruce</span>: OK, thanks."}], "audiosrc": "engenn7le07ob06re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn7le07ob06re2img05.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "id": 1}], "exercises": [{"template_override": 1, "_data": [{"contents": [{"content": " I can talk about jobs and work.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can discuss how to deal with problems.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can talk about what is advisable.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " What types of jobs do people do in restaurants?", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": " Would you like to work in a restaurant? Why or why not?", "type": "Free Header Item"}], "type": "instructions"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Welcome", "type": "group_name"}], "type": "group"}, {"content": {"attempt_feedback": [{"content": "You have 2 tries", "type": "text"}, {"content": "you have 1 attempt left", "type": "text"}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "try again", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time", "type": "text"}], "correct_feedback": "Correct", "allowed_attempts": 2}, "type": "feedback"}, {"content": "Ask your partner:", "type": "free_header_text"}, {"content": "Where's the ma\u00eetre d'?", "type": "free_type_text_area"}], "questions": [], "type": "WLC", "id": 0, "img_path": "", "stimuli_ids": [0]}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [{"contents": [{"content": " Bruce talks to Vanessa about the graveyard shift at Bistro 88. They <span class=\"tool-tip\" id=\"tip_1_0\">could always</span> use another bartender!", "type": "text"}], "type": "instructions"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Content", "type": "group_name"}], "type": "group"}, {"content": {"attempt_feedback": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}, {"content": "", "type": "text"}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "Whoops! Something important is missing.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time...", "type": "text"}], "correct_feedback": "Correct!", "allowed_attempts": 2}, "type": "feedback"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Reading", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "Listening", "type": "skill"}], "type": "learning_skills"}, {"content": [{"content": "<span class=\"italic\">\u201cCould always\u201d</span> is a way of saying that something is both possible and beneficial.", "tip_id": 0, "type": "text"}], "type": "tips"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Instructions: Click on the play button to listen to the audio.", "type": "text"}], "type": "post_instructions"}], "questions": [{"_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "type": "question"}], "id": 0, "responses": [{"correct": 0, "id": 0, "_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0}, {"correct": 1, "id": 1, "_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0}]}], "type": "STI", "id": 1, "stimuli_ids": [1]}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [{"contents": [{"content": " Vanessa and Bruce use <span class=\"tool-tip\" id=\"tip_2_0\">informal language</span> because they are close colleagues at work.", "type": "text"}], "type": "instructions"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Activity 1", "